<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Relay-controlled valve interface. </para>

<para>This module wraps GPIO writes used to open and close solenoid valves through relay outputs.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>Date</title>

<para>Created on Jun 4, 2026 </para>
</formalpara>
<formalpara><title>Author</title>

<para>malaika </para>
</formalpara>
</para>
</section>
